WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,140
Sister Shen takes it

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,440
This is my time

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,880
Jewelry found outside

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,480
Bring it in exchange for what you gave me before

5
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,670
Okay, I'll take it

6
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,550
What do you still need? I'll give it to you

7
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,790
No, you've already given us a lot.

8
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,030
Now these jewelry

9
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,510
You can't exchange for any supplies outside.

10
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:19,270
So have you found fuel today? I'm going south.

11
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:20,390
Find a cannery

12
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,790
The cans were basically emptied

13
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:22,990
But I'm next to Feiqiguo Road

14
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:24,110
Found a lot of compressed carbon cakes

15
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,630
It was all covered in garbage and no one noticed it.

16
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:26,910
Why is there blood on your pants?

17
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:29,070
When I came back, I met several robbers and killed them all.

18
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:29,990
You're not hurt, are you?

19
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:30,950
Just a little scratch

20
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:33,670
Later, I saw rescue teams coming in and out downstairs before I dared to come back.

21
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:35,990
I didn’t expect that I would be pretending to be the captain moving next time.

22
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:38,070
It's safer if we go out as a team, okay?

23
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:51,700
The cold dew has given so many evil reminders

24
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,100
I don’t know how much bigger the space can be this time.

25
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,950
These two are actually fake

26
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:05,500
Upgraded again today
